NOT bundled — downloaded at runtime by the user
-----------------------------------------------
ffmpeg and ffprobe are NOT distributed with this project. On first run,
Bolcap downloads official prebuilt binaries from third parties (BtbN's
FFmpeg-Builds on Windows and Linux, evermeet.cx on macOS) into the user's
own ~/.bolcap directory, verified against pinned checksums.

Those builds are licensed under the GPL by their respective authors.
Bolcap invokes them as separate programs via subprocess and never links
against, modifies, or redistributes them, so their terms apply to those
binaries alone and do not extend to this project's source.

Users who already have ffmpeg/ffprobe on PATH keep theirs; nothing is
downloaded in that case.

Whisper speech recognition models are likewise downloaded on demand from
Hugging Face rather than bundled. The Whisper models are released by
OpenAI under the MIT License.

Optional integrations
---------------------
When configured with the user's own API keys, this project can call
Google Gemini (clip analysis, Hinglish romanization) and Resend
(notification email). Neither is required, and no key ships with the
project.
